  "body": "## What changed\n\nThis change applies the start-side entry law on operation creation and preserves explicit entry selections in edit requests (#3863):\n- Extended `OpParams::with_start_side_entry(prev, named_entry)`: when `named_entry` is true, the method preserves the selected entry without override.\n- Added `CreateOperation::with_named_entry`: applies `with_start_side_entry` against the seed parameters when creating an operation.\n- Added `EditOperationParams::with_named_entry`: passes the `named_entry` flag to `with_start_side_entry`.\n- Updated MCP `add_operation` and `edit_operation` doors to detect if the request parameters contain the `\"entry\"` key and pass `named_entry`.\n- Added tests `mcp_add_operation_with_start_side_takes_arc` and `mcp_edit_operation_with_explicit_helix_and_start_side_keeps_helix` in `crates/app/tests/offset_pass_start/start_side_entry.rs`.\n- Documented the named-entry case in `docs/decisions/3843-start-side-arc.md`.\n\n## Readings\n\n- All targeted integration tests pass cleanly.\n- File length limits: all modified files remain under 400 lines.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `crates/app/tests/offset_pass_start/start_side_entry.rs`:\n  - `start_side_entry::mcp_add_operation_with_start_side_takes_arc`\n  - `start_side_entry::mcp_edit_operation_with_explicit_helix_and_start_side_keeps_helix`\n  - `start_side_entry::a_start_side_edit_of_a_seeded_offset_takes_arc_and_undo_restores_helix`\n  - `start_side_entry::mcp_start_side_edit_takes_arc_and_a_later_helix_choice_stays`\n\n## What was not exercised\n\n- Full workspace test suite (targeted unit and integration tests passed).\n\nChangelog: 2D Offset: apply start-side entry law on create and keep explicit entry choices in edit requests.\n\nFixes #3863\n",
